  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The University of Southern Somalia (USS) is proudly among the 41 top tier universities accredited by the National Commission for Higher Education (NCHE) in Somalia. The USS started its academic operation in May 2007. USS&apos;s main objective  is to educate the next generation of Somali professionals and leaders without regard to their social background, status, or region of origin. Therefore, as an institution, they are committed to promoting diversity in their student body, faculty, and in their curriculum by actively encouraging multiple perspectives of ideas, participation and scholarship. USS has a Vision of being among the leading global academic andresearch institutions, by excelling in the disciplines they offer in the sciences, the social sciences,innovative technology, in the humanities, and in research&#x2014;hence opening doors to prospective students from all the regions of the Federal Republic of Somalia and the rest of the world.</narrative>
  </description>
